  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.0.0:\n      - Modular architecture: separate models (IfcPropertySet, IfcPropertyValue, IfcProductMetadata), options, and internal converters.\n      - Enhanced IfcStoreCache: thread-safe global caching, path canonicalization, and duplicate GlobalId detection.\n      - Added lightweight metadata and property/quantity extraction without full 3D conversion cost.\n      - Added IfcConvertOptions filters for non-physical products and aggregated assembly parts.",
